  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The recent nameplate UI update moves pronouns directly inline with the player's display name and reduces the font size of the name itself. This creates a few readability and usability issues that weren't present in the previous version.\n\nLong pronouns crowd out the nametag. When both are on the same line, the pronouns eat into the visual space reserved for the name, making the entire nameplate stretch far longer than it needs to be.\n\nThe old layout was just cleaner. In the previous version, pronouns were shown on a separate line or as a secondary element below the nametag. This kept the display name front and center while still surfacing pronouns in a way that didn't compete for space.",
